summary.label:
This application is a professional version of the free AutoSender app. It offers a highly flexible and low-cost solution for a variety of personal use and small/medium-sized enterprise (SME) use cases:

- At anywhere in the world you can get multiple US or Canadian phone numbers (private numbers) in the app, and use these numbers for receiving SMS from short code numbers, users can register for multiple social network accounts, such as on-line banking, Apple ID, Facebook, WhatsApp, WeChat, Instagram, Twitter, Gmail, etc.
- Use one or more private numbers to send and receive US/Canada SMS  messages anywhere in the world as if the user is a resident of the US or Canada;
- Use automatic reply, automatic reply-to-all, and automatic forwarding on private numbers for to work as SMS Out-of-Office, customer service, SMS-based answering machines, etc.;
- Use this tool to automate the sending of event notifications, festival greetings, ceremony posters, and other pre-defined messages;
- Automate the sending of texts for recurring tasks, such as paying rental fee, pray reminding, submitting weekly/monthly reports, or handing in assignments;
- Different phone numbers can be used to schedule marketing information for automated sending at predefined times for specific channels. Numbers can receive reply messages from multiple marketing channels, providing an effective solution for small and medium-sized enterprises with limited communication lines;
- All scheduled messaging tasks are executed automatically and reliably in the cloud, making them suitable for mass messaging and telecommuting environments to automatically send text messages to employees or partners for tasks such as meeting notifications, report submissions, instructions, reminders, and more;
- If you want to express your feelings with a romantic text or e-card, this is the perfect tool to bomb and express love texts at the most heart-touching midnight moment;
- Shared Lines: By logging into the same AutoSender (Pro) account on multiple iOS devices, a group of people in different locations can use the same phone number as a shared communication line with the outside world - great for decentralized offices.

 It provides rich features, including the ability to:
- Obtain multiple US and Canadian in-app phone numbers for automatic or manual text message sending at the scheduled date and time. Each US or Canadian number can receive unlimited number of messages for free;
- Integrate ChatGPT to generate high quality, highly expressive message content in seconds;
- Send multiple attachments in one MMS;
- Use professional-level in-app embedded eCard templates for MMS and SMS;
- Create and modify automatic messaging tasks based on the content of the iOS native apps Calendar and Reminders;
- Use other features available in the AutoSender app, such as automatic SMS/MMS sending, free SMS receiving (based on private numbers), automatic SMS reply and automatic SMS forwarding (based on private numbers), group messaging, etc.

We also provide the Standard Subscriptions that offer extra services and features, priced from $0.99 monthly. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period (30 days) and be charged to your iTunes account within 24-hours of the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal. You can manage subscription and auto-renewal can be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase, but refunds will not be provided for any unused portion of the term.

Privacy Policy: https://www.freeramble.com/doc/FreeRamble_Privacy_Policy.html
Terms & Conditions: https://www.freeramble.com/doc/FreeRamble_Terms_Conditions.html

Note:
1) The alphabetical and numerical characters consume one byte per char, and other charset will consume more credits.
2) Only in USA & Canada contacts can receive MMS.
3) Users need to have their own ChatGPT API key to be used in this app.
